;. /select_queries_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition select_queries
  ;= Select named queries
    The catalogue is a captured endpoint.json filesystem record. Selection is a tree of named records: query text, optional argument/name text slots and revision number. Query names, parameters and paging bounds are supplied as inputs. No default query, entity name or page size is assumed. This pure procedure does not fetch data.
    Publish this procedure independently. Invoke it alone using the retain_result
    writer to inspect its work cells, or select it in another authored flow.

    ;@ /flow/input catalogue
    ;= catalogue

    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= selection

    ;@ /flow/step selected ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/select_queries
    ;@ /flow/bind catalogue catalogue
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;= selected

    ;@ /flow/result selected
    ;= Retained result
